{
    "comment": "메일 링크로 들어와 새 비밀번호를 정하는 화면. 인증 전 화면이라 `_admin_base` 를 상속하지 않고\n  테마 3버튼을 스스로 들고 있다(로그인·비밀번호 찾기와 같은 구조).\n  화면은 세 갈래로 갈린다 — 토큰 오류 / 입력 폼 / 성공 안내. 갈림을 정하는 것은 아래 토큰 검증이다.\n  e2e:allow 본인인증 창 선언은 메일 링크 왕복이 필요해 E2E 대신 __tests__/layouts/admin-reset-password-identity-modal.test.ts 와 브라우저 실측으로 잠근다",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "layout_name": "admin_reset_password",
    "meta": {
        "title": "$t:auth.reset_password.title",
        "description": "관리자 비밀번호 재설정 페이지",
        "auth_required": false
    },
    "data_sources": [
        {
            "id": "tokenValidation",
            "label_key": "$t:editor.data_source.tokenValidation",
            "type": "api",
            "endpoint": "/api/auth/validate-reset-token",
            "method": "POST",
            "auto_fetch": true,
            "auth_required": false,
            "loading_strategy": "blocking",
            "params": {
                "token": "{{query.token ?? ''}}",
                "email": "{{query.email ?? ''}}"
            },
            "initLocal": {
                "tokenValid": "{{data.valid ?? false}}"
            },
            "errorHandling": {
                "422": {
                    "handler": "setState",
                    "params": {
                        "target": "local",
                        "tokenError": true
                    }
                },
                "default": {
                    "handler": "setState",
                    "params": {
                        "target": "local",
                        "tokenError": true
                    }
                }
            },
            "comment": "링크의 토큰·메일이 아직 유효한지 먼저 묻는다. `blocking` 인 이유는 결과에 따라 화면 전체가\n       갈리기 때문이다 — 폼을 먼저 그렸다가 무효로 판명되면 이미 입력한 것이 버려진다.\n       422 든 그 밖이든 **똑같이 토큰 오류로 접는다**(만료와 위조를 화면에서 구분해 줄 이유가 없다)."
        }
    ],
    "init_actions": [
        {
            "handler": "initTheme",
            "target": "{{query.theme}}"
        },
        {
            "handler": "setState",
            "params": {
                "target": "local",
                "isSubmitting": false,
                "success": false,
                "resetError": null,
                "resetErrors": null
            }
        }
    ],
    "components": [
        {
            "comment": "전역 토스트 호스트 — `_admin_base` 를 상속하지 않으므로 스스로 둔다(로그인 화면과 같다). 아래 본인인증 창이\n       재전송 결과 등을 토스트로 알리는데, 받는 자리가 없으면 그 안내가 조용히 사라진다.",
            "id": "global_toast",
            "type": "composite",
            "name": "Toast",
            "props": {
                "toasts": "{{_global.toasts}}",
                "position": "bottom-center",
                "duration": 5000
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "reset_page_wrapper",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "flex-center min-h-screen justify-center bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "id": "reset_card_container",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "max-w-md w-full space-y-8"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "id": "reset_card",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-md p-8"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "헤더",
                                    "id": "reset_header",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-center mb-8"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "reset_icon_wrapper",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "if": "{{!_local.tokenError}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "flex-center w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 rounded-full justify-center"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_lock_icon",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "name": "lock",
                                                        "size": "xl",
                                                        "color": "text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "reset_warning_icon_wrapper",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "if": "{{_local.tokenError}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "flex-center w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-900/30 rounded-full justify-center"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_warning_icon",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "name": "triangle-exclamation",
                                                        "size": "xl",
                                                        "color": "text-red-600 dark:text-red-400"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "reset_title",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "H1",
                                            "if": "{{!_local.tokenError}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "text-page-heading mb-2"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.title"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "reset_title_invalid",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "H1",
                                            "if": "{{_local.tokenError}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "text-page-heading mb-2"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.invalid_token_title"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "reset_subtitle",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "P",
                                            "if": "{{!_local.tokenError && !_local.success}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "text-label"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.subtitle"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "comment": "토큰 에러",
                                    "id": "reset_token_error",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "if": "{{_local.tokenError}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-center"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "reset_token_error_text",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "P",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "text-secondary mb-6"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.invalid_token"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "reset_token_error_button",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Button",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "click",
                                                    "handler": "navigate",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "path": "/admin/forgot-password"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "type": "button",
                                                "className": "w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-500 dark:hover:bg-blue-600 text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:ring-offset-2 dark:focus:ring-offset-gray-900 transition-colors duration-200 cursor-pointer"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.go_to_forgot_password"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "comment": "성공 메시지",
                                    "id": "reset_success",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "if": "{{_local.success && !_local.tokenError}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-center"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "reset_success_icon_wrapper",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "alert-success"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_success_text",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "P",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "text-success-soft text-sm"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.success"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "reset_success_login_button",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Button",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "click",
                                                    "handler": "navigate",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "path": "/admin/login"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "type": "button",
                                                "className": "w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-500 dark:hover:bg-blue-600 text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:ring-offset-2 dark:focus:ring-offset-gray-900 transition-colors duration-200 cursor-pointer"
                                            },
                                            "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.go_to_login"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "comment": "비밀번호 재설정 폼",
                                    "id": "reset_form",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Form",
                                    "if": "{{!_local.success && !_local.tokenError}}",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "submit",
                                            "handler": "sequence",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "isSubmitting": true,
                                                        "resetError": null,
                                                        "resetErrors": null
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "apiCall",
                                                    "target": "/api/auth/reset-password",
                                                    "identity_target": {
                                                        "email": "{{query.email ?? ''}}"
                                                    },
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "method": "POST",
                                                        "body": {
                                                            "token": "{{query.token ?? ''}}",
                                                            "email": "{{query.email ?? ''}}",
                                                            "password": "{{form.password}}",
                                                            "password_confirmation": "{{form.password_confirmation}}"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "onSuccess": {
                                                        "handler": "setState",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "target": "local",
                                                            "isSubmitting": false,
                                                            "success": true
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    "onError": {
                                                        "handler": "setState",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "target": "local",
                                                            "isSubmitting": false,
                                                            "resetError": "{{error.message ?? ''}}",
                                                            "resetErrors": "{{error.errors ?? null}}"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "일반 에러 메시지 (필드 에러가 아닌 경우)",
                                            "id": "reset_error_message",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "if": "{{_local.resetError && !_local.resetErrors}}",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "alert-danger"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_error_text",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "P",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "text-error-soft text-center"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{_local.resetError}}"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "comment": "새 비밀번호",
                                            "id": "reset_password_field",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_password_label",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Label",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "htmlFor": "password",
                                                        "className": "form-label"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.password"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_password_input",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Input",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "id": "password",
                                                        "type": "password",
                                                        "name": "password",
                                                        "className": "{{_local.resetErrors?.password ? 'w-full px-4 py-3 border border-red-500 dark:border-red-500 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white placeholder-gray-400 dark:placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:border-red-500 focus:ring-red-500 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors duration-200' : 'w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white placeholder-gray-400 dark:placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-blue-500 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors duration-200'}}",
                                                        "required": true,
                                                        "disabled": "{{_local.isSubmitting ?? false}}"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "켜진 비밀번호 규칙 안내(보안 환경설정 값, #736) — 서버가 같은 규칙으로 검사하고 위반은 이 칸 아래 422 문구로 온다.",
                                                    "id": "reset_password_rules",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "P",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-x-1 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                            "text": "$t:auth.password_rules.min_length|count={{_global.settings?.security?.password_min_length ?? 8}}"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                            "if": "{{!!_global.settings?.security?.require_password_special_char}}",
                                                            "text": "$t:auth.password_rules.special"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                            "if": "{{!!_global.settings?.security?.password_require_char_types}}",
                                                            "text": "$t:auth.password_rules.char_types"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                            "if": "{{!!_global.settings?.security?.password_block_identifier}}",
                                                            "text": "$t:auth.password_rules.identifier"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                            "if": "{{!!_global.settings?.security?.password_block_repeated_chars}}",
                                                            "text": "$t:auth.password_rules.repeated|count={{_global.settings?.security?.password_repeated_chars_length ?? 4}}"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                            "if": "{{!!_global.settings?.security?.password_block_sequential_chars}}",
                                                            "text": "$t:auth.password_rules.sequential|count={{_global.settings?.security?.password_sequential_chars_length ?? 4}}"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Span",
                                                            "if": "{{!!_global.settings?.security?.password_reuse_prevention_enabled}}",
                                                            "text": "$t:auth.password_rules.reuse|count={{_global.settings?.security?.password_reuse_count ?? 3}}"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_password_error",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "P",
                                                    "if": "{{_local.resetErrors?.password}}",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "mt-2 text-sm text-red-600 dark:text-red-400"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{Array.isArray(_local.resetErrors?.password) ? _local.resetErrors.password[0] : _local.resetErrors?.password}}"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "comment": "비밀번호 확인",
                                            "id": "reset_password_confirm_field",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_password_confirm_label",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Label",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "htmlFor": "password_confirmation",
                                                        "className": "form-label"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.password_confirmation"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_password_confirm_input",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Input",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "id": "password_confirmation",
                                                        "type": "password",
                                                        "name": "password_confirmation",
                                                        "className": "{{_local.resetErrors?.password_confirmation ? 'w-full px-4 py-3 border border-red-500 dark:border-red-500 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white placeholder-gray-400 dark:placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:border-red-500 focus:ring-red-500 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors duration-200' : 'w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white placeholder-gray-400 dark:placeholder-gray-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-blue-500 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors duration-200'}}",
                                                        "required": true,
                                                        "disabled": "{{_local.isSubmitting ?? false}}"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_password_confirm_error",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "P",
                                                    "if": "{{_local.resetErrors?.password_confirmation}}",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "mt-2 text-sm text-red-600 dark:text-red-400"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{Array.isArray(_local.resetErrors?.password_confirmation) ? _local.resetErrors.password_confirmation[0] : _local.resetErrors?.password_confirmation}}"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "comment": "제출 버튼",
                                            "id": "reset_submit_button",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Button",
                                            "props": {
                                                "type": "submit",
                                                "className": "flex-center w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-500 dark:hover:bg-blue-600 text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:ring-offset-2 dark:focus:ring-offset-gray-900 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed transition-colors duration-200 justify-center gap-2",
                                                "disabled": "{{_local.isSubmitting ?? false}}"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_submit_spinner",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Div",
                                                    "if": "{{_local.isSubmitting}}",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "w-5 h-5 border-2 border-white/30 border-t-white rounded-full animate-spin"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_submit_text",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "if": "{{!_local.isSubmitting}}",
                                                    "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.submit"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_submit_processing",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "if": "{{_local.isSubmitting}}",
                                                    "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.processing"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "comment": "언어 셀렉터",
                            "id": "reset_language_selector_container",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "mt-6"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "id": "reset_language_selector",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Select",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "change",
                                            "handler": "setLocale",
                                            "target": "{{$event.target.value}}"
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "block w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 shadow-sm focus:border-blue-500 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm",
                                        "value": "{{$locale}}",
                                        "options": "{{$locales ?? []}}"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "comment": "테마 Segmented Control",
                            "id": "reset_theme_selector_container",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "mt-4 flex justify-center"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "id": "reset_theme_segmented_control",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "inline-flex bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-1 gap-1"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "reset_theme_light_button",
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Button",
                                            "actions": [
                                                {
                                                    "comment": "밝은 테마 고정 — 인증 전 화면 3종이 각자 들고 있는 같은 3버튼 중 하나다.",
                                                    "type": "click",
                                                    "handler": "setTheme",
                                                    "target": "light"
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "props": {
                                                "type": "button",
                                                "className": "{{_global.theme === 'light' ? 'p-2 rounded-md bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 shadow-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 transition-all duration-200' : 'p-2 rounded-md text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 dark:hover:text-gray-300 transition-all duration-200'}}",
                                                "title": "$t:admin.theme.light"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "reset_theme_light_icon",
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "name": "sun",
                                                        "size": "sm"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
